e in flight, attention can survey and rank what needs focus."}]},{"id":"blk-41805","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46421","text":"Autonomy modes:"}]},{"id":"blk-41806","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41808","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46422","marks":["code"],"text":"observe"},{"id":"spn-46423","text":" (read-only prioritization)"}]}],"id":"blk-41807","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41810","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46424","marks":["code"],"text":"advise"},{"id":"spn-46425","text":" (recommend actions)"}]}],"id":"blk-41809","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41812","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46426","marks":["code"],"text":"act"},{"id":"spn-46427","text":" (dispatch bounded actions)"}]}],"id":"blk-41811","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-41813","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46428","text":"Attention combines urgency, coverage state, and topology complexity to prioritize execution."}]},{"id":"blk-41814","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46429","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-41815","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-46430","text":"8) Consolidation Cycle (Memory Maintenance)"}]},{"id":"blk-41816","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46431","text":"Consolidation keeps memory quality healthy over time."}]},{"id":"blk-41817","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46432","text":"The 7-stage pipeline includes:"}]},{"id":"blk-41818","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46433","text":"1. Confidence decay 2. Prune weak nodes 3. Prune weak edges 4. Strengthen co-activated edges 5. Merge similar nodes 6. Promote timescale (fast → medium → slow → glacial) 7. Generate abstractions from episodic clusters"}]},{"id":"blk-41819","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46434","text":"Operationally, run consolidation:"}]},{"id":"blk-41820","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41822","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46435","text":"at session boundaries"}]}],"id":"blk-41821","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41824","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46436","text":"after heavy write bursts"}]}],"id":"blk-41823","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41826","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46437","text":"periodically during long autonomous loops"}]}],"id":"blk-41825","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-41827","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46438","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-41828","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-46439","text":"9) End-to-End Example Walkthrough"}]},{"id":"blk-41829","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46440","text":"A complete interaction often looks like this:"}]},{"id":"blk-41830","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46441","text":"1. Agent retrieves context for user task. 2. Runtime returns ranked results + causal context + topology signal. 3. Agent performs work and returns output. 4. Agent stores key new semantic/procedural/episodic nodes. 5. Agent reports outcome against causal nodes. 6. Goal progress is updated. 7. Coverage is reviewed before next consequential step. 8. Consolidation runs to maintain graph quality."}]},{"id":"blk-41831","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46442","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-41832","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-46443","text":"10) Operational Checklist"}]},{"id":"blk-41833","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46444","text":"Before ending a productive session:"}]},{"id":"blk-41834","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41836","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46445","text":"[ ] Store key durable knowledge"}]}],"id":"blk-41835","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41838","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46446","text":"[ ] Report outcomes for consequential actions"}]}],"id":"blk-41837","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41840","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46447","text":"[ ] Update linked goals/progress/status"}]}],"id":"blk-41839","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41842","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46448","text":"[ ] Trigger or verify consolidation"}]}],"id":"blk-41841","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41844","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46449","text":"[ ] Confirm runtime remains healthy"}]}],"id":"blk-41843","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-41845","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46450","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-41846","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-46451","text":"11) Common Failure Patterns to Avoid"}]},{"id":"blk-41847","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41849","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46452","text":"skipping retrieval on non-trivial tasks"}]}],"id":"blk-41848","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41851","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46453","text":"losing causal context before outcome reporting"}]}],"id":"blk-41850","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41853","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46454","text":"inflating confidence without evidence"}]}],"id":"blk-41852","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41855","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46455","text":"storing kitchen-sink nodes"}]}],"id":"blk-41854","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41857","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46456","text":"fabricating coverage or outcome signals"}]}],"id":"blk-41856","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41859","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46457","text":"ignoring repeated "},{"id":"spn-46458","marks":["code"],"text":"learn"},{"id":"spn-46459","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-46460","marks":["code"],"text":"escalate"},{"id":"spn-46461","text":" routing"}]}],"id":"blk-41858","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-41860","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46462","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-41861","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-46463","text":"12) Suggested Next Reads"}]},{"id":"blk-41862","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41864","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"i